The **Shady Teacher** just joined the faculty and seems to know
his subject, yet something about him is wrong. Perhaps it's the
sunglasses he never takes off, even inside -- or the students who
keep vanishing from his class.

**Attributes:** Art of Invisibility +2, Perceptive +2, Smart +3; Absent-Minded -1, Fussy -1, Quirk -1 (Always Wears Sunglasses), Secret -2 (To Everybody).

